                "verification": {
                    "payload": "tree 98601919c9e6bbef52ee38c9c1b05fa539259c91\nparent 580fc599ec10be207758c97e82b07ca2677fd538\nauthor iphydf <iphydf@users.noreply.github.com> 1778975655 +0000\ncommitter iphydf <iphydf@users.noreply.github.com> 1778975655 +0000\n\nfix: Make circleci-bazel-test work with multiple glibc versions.\n\nThe `--set-interpreter` glob `/nix/store/*-glibc-*/...` matched two glibc\nversions in the rebuilt toktok-stack image, producing a malformed patchelf\ninvocation. Take the interpreter from an existing system binary instead.\n",
